  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">May 6 Conference on migration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Ensure the participation of government officials from key southern partner countries and CSO representatives in order to also secure diverse perspectives on today&#x2019;s challenges related to different types of migration flows throughout the migration conference.
- Support to max 3 ministerial delegations and 10 researchers/CSO representatives with flight tickets and/or accommodation (no first class or business flight tickets will be accepted).
- Support to attendance by funding associated travel costs and/or accommodation, will also contribute to strengthening of sustainable partnerships to collectively address the challenges related to irregular migration and forced displacement.</narrative>
  </description>
